# Play test of Skyrope Peaks (CIPlay skyrope_peaks, in a test world 'CI ...'): a flying island (58 m up; heights count
# from the island's own water line). No quest: the meadow, up the ladders to the east peak, over the rope bridge to the
# west peak's cabin and back, the two chests, the screecher. Points as in its recipe.
island Skyrope Peaks
offset 0 0
expect animals Screecher 1
wait 3
kill Screecher
at 0 -10
expect height 6.7
climb 13 -7.15 h=6.7
expect stand 13 -5 h=14 below=15.5
at 15 1 h=14
open Chest on the east peak
# Over the bridge to the west peak
walk 9 0 to 4 0 to -4 0 to -9.5 0 h=16 below=18
at -15 0 h=16
open Chest in the peak cabin
